{"version":2,"width":112,"height":32,"timestamp":1788544926,"idle_time_limit":2.0,"command":"./scripts/demo-session.sh","env":{"SHELL":"/bin/zsh"}}
[0.24383, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[H\u001b[1mPOLIGN MULTI-COLLECTION + MULTIMODAL RAG\u001b[0m\r\nmemory -> scoped candidates -> visual cache -> research -> review -> summary\r\n"]
[0.24401, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m1. Four independent collections in one durable Polign database\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.251407, "o", "\r\n\u001b[2m$ .venv/bin/polign-curator collections\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.171197, "o", "{\r\n  \"curator_memory\": 2,\r\n  \"nga_candidates\": 7,\r\n  \"art_context\": 8,\r\n  \"visual_cache\": 2\r\n}\r\n"]
[3.18337, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m2. Curator preferences live in memory, not model context\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[4.190577, "o", "\r\n\u001b[2m$"]
[4.190608, "o", " .venv/bin/polign-curator memories"]
[4.190666, "o", " --history\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[5.066248, "o", "[\r\n  {\r\n    \"created_at\": \"2026-09-04T17:53:48.565464+00:00\",\r\n    \"document\": \"constraint: avoid theme = industrial triumphalism\",\r\n    \"key\": \"avoid_theme\",\r\n    \"kind\": \"constraint\",\r\n    \"status\": \"active\",\r\n    \"user_id\": \"demo-curator\",\r\n    \"value\": \"industrial triumphalism\"\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    \"created_at\": \"2026-09-04T17:53:48.511987+00:00\",\r\n    \"document\": \"preference: preferred mood = quiet and contemplative\",\r\n    \"key\": \"preferred_mood\",\r\n    \"kind\": \"preference\",\r\n    \"status\": \"active\",\r\n    \"user_id\": \"demo-curator\",\r\n    \"value\": \"quiet and contemplative\"\r\n  }\r\n]\r\n"]
[6.077933, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m3. Replay the verified live run; cached observations avoided re-sending images\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[7.089534, "o", "\r\n\u001b[2m$ polign-curator ask --summary \"Inspect the actual images of The Japanese Footbridge and Flower Beds in Holland. Compare their edge cropping, depth cues, and directional brushwork, then explain which better supports a quiet contemplative room.\"\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[8.105869, "o", "  -> recalled 2 active memories from curator_memory\r\n  -> retrieved 6 eligible works from nga_candidates\r\n     filter: candidate_set='river-and-landscape-2026', eligible=true\r\n  -> visual decision: needed=True\r\n     edge cropping, depth cues, and brushwork require the actual images\r\n  -> reused visual_cache observation for nga-74796\r\n  -> reused visual_cache observation for nga-61371\r\n  -> retrieved 6 supporting passages from art_context\r\n  -> created evidence-tagged draft\r\n  -> independent review score=80, passed=False\r\n  -> revised draft once from reviewer feedback\r\n  -> final review score=96, passed=True\r\n  -> summarized reviewed draft\r\n\r\nReview: 96/100, passed=true\r\n\r\n"]
[8.105896, "o", "In short\r\n- Choose Monet's The Japanese Footbridge for the quiet contemplative room.\r\n  Tight upper cropping, shallow depth, and interwoven brushwork make the\r\n  visual field more enclosing and settled. [IMG:visual-6249ffa81ccc66a74e68]\r\n  [CTX:ctx-footbridge-enclosure]\r\n- Van Gogh's Flower Beds in Holland has stronger recession and repeated\r\n  directional rows, producing a more forward-driving composition.\r\n  [IMG:visual-fc1f5f0ea63f02311e0f] [CAND:nga-61371]\r\n\r\nSources\r\nhttps://www.nga.gov/artworks/74796-japanese-footbridge\r\nhttps://www.nga.gov/artworks/61371-flower-beds-holland\r\n\r\n"]
[10.115628, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m4. The visual observations remain durable in their own collection\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.126979, "o", "\r\n\u001b[2m$"]
[11.127001, "o", " .venv/bin/polign-curator collections"]
[11.127044, "o", "\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.01705, "o", "{\r\n  \"curator_memory\": 2,\r\n  \"nga_candidates\": 7,\r\n  \"art_context\": 8,\r\n  \"visual_cache\": 2\r\n}\r\n"]
[13.029882, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mDone: filtered retrieval, multimodal evidence, independent review, final summary.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[13.031625, "x", "0"]
